# Haze of Rage as the first spell of turn 3, without buyback: storm copies it for each spell cast before it this turn, none,
# so it pumps once; "creatures you control get +1/+0 until end of turn" is a one-shot effect on the creatures there as it
# resolves (CR 611.2c), so Bot1's Ornithopter has power 1, Bot2's has 0, and a second Ornithopter Bot1 casts afterwards
# gets nothing. Without buyback the Haze goes to the graveyard, and the pump is gone at the next turn.

